      <\/span>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"w-100 custom-vh-50 border-file-read rounded d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center\">\r\n    <div class=\"text-window overflow-auto p-2 thin-scrollbar-thumb-route-gray thin-scrollbar-lg w-100 h-100 text-gray-reader ck-content\">\r\n        <h1><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>H\u01af\u1edaNG D\u1eaaN L\u00c0M B\u00c0I T\u1eacP V\u1ec0 NH\u00c0 &amp; N\u1ed8P B\u00c0I L\u00caN LMS<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>1. M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 truy\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea3n th\u00e2n \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c b\u1eb1ng ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, d\u1ec5 hi\u1ec3u th\u00f4ng qua ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng vi\u1ebft.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Bi\u1ebft giao ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c v\u00e0 AI m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, gi\u00fap r\u00e8n luy\u1ec7n k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng vi\u1ebft lu\u1eadn (Essay) ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt th\u00f4ng qua qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh: l\u00ean \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng \u2192 vi\u1ebft \u2192 h\u1ecdc t\u1eadp \u2192 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda \u2192 ph\u1ea3n t\u01b0<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;H\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi t\u1eeb nh\u1eadn x\u00e9t c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 v\u00e0 gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean tr\u00ean h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng LMS.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>2. Quy \u0111\u1ecbnh chung<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft ph\u1ea3i do ch\u00ednh sinh vi\u00ean t\u1ef1 vi\u1ebft (kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c copy).<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 3 t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi n\u1ed9p:<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">1. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft g\u1ed1c vi\u1ebft t\u1ea1i l\u1edbp (ch\u1ee5p h\u00ecnh ho\u1eb7c scan b\u1ea3n vi\u1ebft tay).<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">2. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;B\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda sau khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng AI, c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 vi\u1ebft l\u1ea1i tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">3. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Phi\u1ebfu ph\u1ea3n t\u01b0: Memo m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u1ed7i \u0111\u00e3 m\u1eafc ph\u1ea3i ho\u1eb7c ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c m\u1edbi \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ecdc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean m\u1eabu gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean cung c\u1ea5p.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;B\u00e0i t\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9p l\u00ean h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng LMS \u0111\u00fang h\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1eadn nh\u1eadn x\u00e9t t\u1eeb gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>3. C\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><i><u>\ud83d\udd39 B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Vi\u1ebft b\u00e0i t\u1ea1i l\u1edbp<\/u><\/i><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Th\u1ea3o lu\u1eadn v\u1edbi gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 v\u1ec1 \u0111\u1ec1 t\u00e0i, n\u1ed9i dung ch\u00ednh, b\u1ed1 c\u1ee5c.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;L\u00ean \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 vi\u1ebft b\u00e0i lu\u1eadn b\u1eb1ng tay trong th\u1eddi gian tr\u00ean l\u1edbp.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Ch\u1ee5p l\u1ea1i b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft sau khi ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ec3 l\u01b0u gi\u1eef.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><i><u>\ud83d\udd39 B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: G\u00f5 l\u1ea1i v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda t\u1ea1i nh\u00e0<\/u><\/i><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;D\u00f9ng m\u00e1y t\u00ednh g\u00f5 l\u1ea1i n\u1ed9i dung b\u00e0i \u0111\u00e3 vi\u1ebft t\u1ea1i l\u1edbp.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 AI (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: ChatGPT) \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1edd g\u1ee3i \u00fd ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda v\u00e0 c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Ghi l\u1ea1i c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec3m m\u00ecnh \u0111\u00e3 sai, c\u00e1c c\u00e1ch di\u1ec5n \u0111\u1ea1t t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n, ho\u1eb7c ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c m\u1edbi m\u00e0 AI \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Vi\u1ebft l\u1ea1i m\u1ed9t b\u1ea3n ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean nh\u1eefng ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i.<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><i><u>\ud83d\udd39 B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: L\u00e0m phi\u1ebfu ph\u1ea3n t\u01b0<\/u><\/i><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Sau khi ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh vi\u1ec7c vi\u1ebft sakubun, \u0111i\u1ec1n m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u1ed7i \u0111\u00e3 m\u1eafc ho\u1eb7c ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c m\u1edbi \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ecdc qua qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh luy\u1ec7n t\u1eadp v\u00e0o phi\u1ebfu ph\u1ea3n t\u01b0 m\u00e0 gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean \u0111\u00e3 cung c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ec3 l\u01b0u tr\u1eef, \u00f4n t\u1eadp v\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng sau n\u00e0y.&nbsp;<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><i><u>\ud83d\udd39 B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: N\u1ed9p b\u00e0i l\u00ean LMS<\/u><\/i><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;T\u1eadp h\u1ee3p 3 file:<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">o &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft g\u1ed1c (\u1ea3nh ho\u1eb7c PDF)<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">o &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;B\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">o &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Phi\u1ebfu ph\u1ea3n t\u01b0<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;\u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng LMS \u2192 M\u1ee5c \"Test\u201d Part 5 c\u1ee7a m\u1ed7i Unit\"<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\u2022 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;T\u1ea3i l\u00ean \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 c\u00e1c t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u tr\u01b0\u1edbc h\u1ea1n n\u1ed9p (ghi r\u00f5 trong m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau h\u1ecdc t\u1eadp tu\u1ea7n).<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><i><strong><u>C\u00e1ch \u0111\u1eb7t t\u00ean file:<\/u><\/strong><\/i><\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\uf0a7 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(B\u1ea3n g\u1ed1c) Unit 13_H\u1ecd v\u00e0 t\u00ean_Sakubun_Genkou<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\uf0a7 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(B\u1ea3n ho\u00e0n ch\u1ec9nh) Unit 13_H\u1ecd v\u00e0 t\u00ean_Sakubun_Final Sakubun<\/span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">\uf0a7 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(Phi\u1ebfu ph\u1ea3n t\u01b0) Unit 13_H\u1ecd v\u00e0 t\u00ean_Furikaeri<\/span><\/h1>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"pr-3 pt-3\">\r\n        <h3>Guide files<\/h3>\r\n        <div class=\"my-3\">\r\n                            <div class=\"d-flex-not-important align-items-center px-2 bg-white-wannabe-grey rounded mb-1 width-fit-content max-width-100\">\r\n                    <div class=\"file-name mr-1 px-1 max-width-100 text-break\">\r\n                        Unit13.pdf\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n                    <a href=\"https:\/\/storage.googleapis.com\/nilc02-storage\/activities\/Unit13.pdf\" class=\"bg-transparent btn\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n                        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-download\"><\/i>\r\n                    <\/a>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n    <\/div>\r\n                    <\/di